sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as lightkeeper --watch
    participant N as Nightscout
    participant D as Display and files
    participant H as Home Assistant (MQTT)
    participant S as systemd
    L->>N: GET /api/v1/entries (token in api-secret header)
    alt fetch succeeds
        N-->>L: JSON list
        L->>L: parse, drop bad entries, keep newest
    else fetch fails
        L->>L: re-age the last good reading (it turns STALE on its own)
    end
    L->>L: classify (STALE first), render 3 or 4 lines
    L->>D: print, write SVG and JSON atomically
    L->>H: publish level (never retained)
    L->>S: WATCHDOG=1, STATUS=level
    Note over L,S: a hung cycle stops the pings and systemd restarts the service
    L->>L: sleep the interval, repeat
